NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA

The isotope masses and natural abundances used by this program are values
published by NIST (Atomic Weights and Isotopic Compositions), extracted via
the molmass package. They are measured physical constants and are not
claimed as part of this work. The literature linked in the briefings and
appendices belongs to its respective publishers and is referenced, not
redistributed.


